&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.auctane.com/uploads/fhmikF1ylz02TLjtkC429w.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot;&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auctane, we are united by a passion to help businesses deliver — whatever their size, wherever they are, and however they operate. We make it possible for businesses to meet the ever-changing requirements of their industry and customer expectations. Auctane products enable hundreds of thousands of businesses to annually mail and ship billions of items — over $200 billion worth — to recipients around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Auctane family of mailing and shipping software products includes ShipStation, Stamps.com, ShipStation API, Metapack, GlobalPost, and Packlink. Our partners include Amazon, UPS, USPS, eBay, BigCommerce, Shopify, WooCommerce, and Walmart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://postimg.cc/N5Q8NR10&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Make it Right. Play to Win. Win as One&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.auctane.com/uploads/fhmikF1ylz02TLjtkC429w.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot;&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a commercially minded Product Director to lead Metapack&#39;s enterprise product strategy, roadmap and investment. You will balance the needs of our existing enterprise customers with the development of scalable capabilities across the wider ShipStation Global portfolio. Reporting to the European Product Leader, this is a product leadership role for someone with proven experience building and managing enterprise SaaS products. You will combine deep customer understanding with strong commercial judgement and the ability to navigate complex software environments, shape platform strategy and lead product teams to deliver measurable business and customer outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is a hybrid remote opportunity based in London.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Metapack product roadmap, prioritisation and investment decisions, balancing customer needs, commercial returns and long-term platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and grow the Product Management team, working closely with Engineering, Architecture, Design, Data, Operations and Commercial leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development of shared product capabilities, including tracking and analytics, that can be leveraged across the wider ShipStation Global portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the API Product Director to align customer requirements and integration priorities across APIs, carrier systems, WMS, OMS, ERP and ecommerce platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the operational complexity of large enterprise customers, translating their business needs, workflows and requirements into scalable product capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead platform simplification, consolidation and migration initiatives, balancing customer commitments with long-term technical and product sustainability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product performance and commercial outcomes, using metrics such as ARR, retention, expansion, contribution, adoption and cost to serve to guide investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Solutions, Customer Success and Account Management on strategic opportunities, RFPs, solution design, renewals and customer escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with enterprise customers and senior stakeholders, representing Product in strategic reviews, QBRs and industry events, and making clear trade-offs between customer needs, strategic priorities and technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven product leadership in enterprise B2B SaaS, with substantial direct ownership of customer-facing enterprise products or platforms — this is mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 7+ years in product management, including significant experience leading product strategy, teams and commercial outcomes at Director, Head of Product or equivalent level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep practical understanding of enterprise software ecosystems, including complex implementation, integration, configuration, data, security, governance and support needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for complex, high-volume operations, multiple user personas, roles and permissions, and customers operating across sites, regions or business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing international enterprise customer relationships and leading globally distributed Product and Engineering teams based in London and Poland, with the ability to collaborate effectively across regions, cultures, and time zones (including US Central Time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise procurement, RFPs, security and technical due diligence, contractual commitments, long sales cycles, and renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage credibly with senior customer stakeholders and executives while working effectively with architects and engineers on complex technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication and presentation skills, with comfort presenting and public speaking to senior customer stakeholders, internal executive audiences, and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English proficiency (not necessarily native)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong alignment with company values (‘Play to Win’, ‘Make it Right’, ‘Win as One’) — collaborative, action-oriented, pragmatic, highly accountable, adaptable, and enthusiastic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What will make you stand out?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics, shipping, carrier management, fulfilment, retail operations or supply-chain software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform consolidation, legacy modernisation, product migration or post-merger portfolio integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnerships, white-label propositions, enterprise integration ecosystems or build-versus-partner decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data products, analytics and responsible application of AI to complex enterprise workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #11003a; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px; border: 3px solid #5C50FF; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What do we offer?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 Clear and transparent compensation plan. The salary range for this role is £ 115,807 - £ 150,550 depending on experience. We will discuss the indicated range with you in the first recruiting call to ensure that we are on the same page.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Annual Salary Review: We are reviewing the salaries of all our teams annually in order to evaluate an increase according to individual performance and the business results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 99% discount on your personal shipment orders via Packlink.pro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💙 Up to 150 USD/year to match your NGO donations! We are happy to support your initiatives by duplicating the amount donated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;😊 Volunteer day. You can take 1 day off per year in order to participate in volunteering activities! We will love to see some pictures in our slack!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referral Fee 🔗 We need your support in hiring top-class talent! We offer a referral bonus of 1k-3K, depending on the complexity of the role and the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👩‍⚕️We have an Employee Assistance Program with psychological assistance free of charge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚖️ Great work-life balance. We offer a flexible work schedule and will do our best to adapt to your personal situation. Working in a fast-paced environment can be intense, but that doesn’t mean you shouldn’t enjoy your free time!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💜 An inclusive and upbeat work environment. Leave your suit behind... we’re a t-shirt and converse kind of place! More importantly, our company culture promotes diversity and inclusion. The personality and opinions of each of our team members are important and valid, and we aim to offer all employees a safe environment where they can be themselves and thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 A cross-cultural atmosphere. We are a truly international team of 20 nationalities that speak 10 languages. Our company language is English and all internal communication and company-wide meetings are in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏟️ Company events. Work hard, play hard! We do our best every day, even at our regular team-building events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📺 Internal and external training, free access to online training platforms such as Linkedin Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏠 We are a remote-friendly company. All team members at Auctane UK can work from home once or twice per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌅 We have 25 days of holidays per year. Once you complete 2 years ‘service, the basic paid holiday entitlement will increase by 2 days, bringing the total to 27 days. For each additional year, the entitlement will increase by an&amp;nbsp;additional day up to a maximum of 5 years and effectively, 5 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Everything you need to work from home. We set you up for success when working at office or remotely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📙 Personal Training Budget. Up to 2.000€/year training budget (certifications, conferences attendance, etc.) to invest in your professional development. We want to help you improve your technical skills, feel involved in the product community, and develop your soft skills to lead teams and manage other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💰 Pension Scheme. We operate a contributory Pension Scheme on behalf of its employees. Auctane&amp;nbsp;contributes up to 4% to the employee’s pension, providing the employee matches the&amp;nbsp;contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🛡️ We got you covered. You can take advantage of our Group Life Assurance and our Group Income Protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤰🏽 Enhanced Maternity and Paternity Leave. Auctane enhances both maternity and paternity pay. Three months of maternity leave or&amp;nbsp;two weeks of paternity leave will be paid at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚼 Tax-Free Childcare. You may be eligible for tax free childcare. You can get up to £500 every 3 months (£2,000 a&amp;nbsp;year) for each of your children to help with the costs of childcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚴‍♀️ Take care of the environment by Cycling to Work. In conjunction with the Government scheme Green Transport Plan, the Company offers a subsidised cycle purchase scheme which by offering tax incentives can save up to 50% of&amp;nbsp;bicycle&#39;s retail cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏐 Health and Wellness: The well-being of our team is super important to us. &amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the gym membership with Nuffield Health Bloomsbury situated near the London office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide a Private Medical Insurance scheme for all employees&amp;nbsp;who wish to join, with an option to add eligible family members at their own cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimbursement of a yearly eye examination up to the value of £20 and £50&amp;nbsp;towards lenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏢 Nice Office in the center of London (free drinks, snacks…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

