&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Networking, Security, Platform, DevOps, Databricks, Cloud - AWS, GCP, Azure, Infrastructure&lt;strong&gt; - &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;First preference would be GCP experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
