&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peace of mind protection:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
