&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #662d91;&quot;&gt;Teamwork makes the stream work.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roku is changing how the world watches TV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the #1 TV streaming platform in the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, and we&#39;ve set our sights on powering every television in the world. Roku pioneered streaming to the TV. Our mission is to be the TV streaming platform that connects the entire TV ecosystem. We connect consumers to the content they love, enable content publishers to build and monetize large audiences, and provide advertisers unique capabilities to engage consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day at Roku, you&#39;ll make a valuable - and valued - contribution. We&#39;re a fast-growing public company where no one is a bystander. We offer you the opportunity to delight millions of TV streamers around the world while gaining meaningful experience across a variety of disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What is the role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;Roku&#39;s Content Distribution team drives strategic growth by sourcing, negotiating, and closing distribution partnerships with leading streaming video providers and major TV networks. As Director, Content Distribution, UK, you will lead strategy and execution for Roku&#39;s content distribution business in the UK. You will directly own high-value, complex negotiations with local public service broadcasters (PSBs), operators, and digital distributors, and guide the long-term roadmap for partner acquisition, renewals, and revenue expansion in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;This role requires a senior leader with a proven track record of closing large, strategic content deals, deep expertise in streaming and subscription business models, and established C-level relationships across the UK media industry. You will shape how Roku is perceived by the local media community and represent Roku in the UK and EU.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;How will I use AI at Roku?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;At Roku, we don’t just use AI, we work with it. AI agents and smart tools help power drafts, analysis, and repetitive workflows, while our people bring direction, judgment, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;We value curious, adaptable builders, who can show how they’ve used AI, agents, or automation to move faster, improve quality, and scale their impact. Strong candidates know how to frame problems, guide AI-assisted work, check the output, and learn quickly. Above all, they bring curiosity, adaptability, and sound judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What are the responsibilities of the role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Deal Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end negotiation of major content distribution, premium subscription, and advertising inventory deals with UK PSBs (e.g., BBC, ITV, Channel 4), operators, and SVOD, AVOD, TVOD, and premium channel providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Own the strategic vision, roadmap, and financial performance of UK Content Distribution, including revenue management, ensuring sustained partner and revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary executive-level relationship owner for key UK partners, driving alignment on long-term collaboration, business strategy, and deal expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Negotiate advertising arrangements, including ad inventory splits, revenue shares, and backfill agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development &amp;amp; Deal Structuring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Lead all aspects of new partner development, including sourcing, financial modeling, forecasting, term-sheet creation, contract drafting, negotiations, and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Own renewal strategy for the installed base of UK contracts, including re-negotiating major deals and developing a plan to upgrade existing Roku partnerships to the next level, in partnership with Roku&#39;s Legal team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Provide cross-functional leadership to legal, finance, marketing, product, and ad sales teams throughout negotiations and ongoing partnership management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics, Strategy, &amp;amp; Executive Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Develop and present strategic materials, including deal strategies, quarterly updates, executive level presentations, and analysis of the UK media landscape and broader industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Evaluate potential channel partners using deep analysis of content value, market demand and appeal, competitive positioning, financial modeling, and long-term strategic fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Continuously analyze current channel applications and competitor lineups to prioritize channel onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Monitor industry trends, competitive dynamics, and the evolving UK streaming ecosystem to inform Roku&#39;s content distribution strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Support the content acquisition team by researching content trends, identifying ad innovations, and recommending new partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Oversee the lifecycle of UK partner contracts, including compliance, renewals, and operational optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Build and mentor a high-performing team focused on complex negotiations, partner management, and business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Establish scalable processes to manage a large and diverse portfolio of partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What experience would help someone be successful in this role at Roku?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in content distribution, business development, or media partnerships at a leading broadcaster, operator, streaming platform, or media company, including direct ownership of major deal negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;A proven, high-level network of traditional and digital media executives across the UK, including direct experience working with C-level leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of subscription streaming models, linear licensing agreements, and advertising economics, including the UK advertising ecosystem, ad inventory pricing and structures, and direct, programmatic, and audience-based monetization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Extensive experience working with legal teams on complex distribution agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Strong executive presence and exceptional communication skills, with the ability to influence and build relationships with senior and mid-level leaders, internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Demonstrated excellence in financial modeling, competitive analysis, and strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Revenue management experience, and experience working with media sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;A demonstrated passion for the UK media landscape and a solid understanding of streaming media technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Proven success leading cross-functional initiatives and managing multiple high-impact deals simultaneously, with 5+ years of people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required; MBA, JD, or similar advanced degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-6&quot;&gt;#LI-OR1&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Roku&#39;s approach to hybrid working?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku fosters an inclusive and collaborative environment where teams generally work in the office Monday through Thursday. Fridays are generally flexible for remote work, except for employees whose specific roles or assigned office location require five days&#39; a week attendance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are some of the benefits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is committed to offering a diverse range of benefits as part of our compensation package to support our employees and their families. Our comprehensive benefits include global access to mental health and financial wellness support and resources. Local benefits include statutory and voluntary benefits which may include healthcare (medical, dental, and vision), life, accident, disability, commuter, and retirement options (401(k)/pension). Employees are supported in taking time off, in accordance with local leave policies and other personal needs to support their evolving work and life needs. It&#39;s important to note that not every benefit is available in all locations or for every role. For details specific to your location, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku welcomes applicants of all backgrounds and provides reasonable accommodations and adjustments in accordance with applicable law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point in the hiring process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What should I know about Roku&#39;s culture?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is a great place for people who want to work in a fast-paced environment where everyone is focused on the company&#39;s success rather than their own. We try to surround ourselves with people who are great at their jobs, who are easy to work with, and who keep their egos in check. We appreciate a sense of humor. We believe a fewer number of very talented folks can do more for less cost than a larger number of less talented teams. We&#39;re independent thinkers with big ideas who act boldly, move fast and accomplish extraordinary things through collaboration and trust. In short, at Roku you&#39;ll be part of a company that&#39;s changing how the world watches TV. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique culture that we are proud of. We think of ourselves primarily as problem-solvers, which itself is a two-part idea. We come up with the solution, but the solution isn&#39;t real until it is built and delivered to the customer. That penchant for action gives us a pragmatic approach to innovation, one that has served us well since 2002. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about Roku, our global footprint, and how we&#39;ve grown, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&quot;&gt;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #662d91;&quot;&gt;Teamwork makes the stream work.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roku is changing how the world watches TV&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is the #1 TV streaming platform in the U.S., Canada, and Mexico, and we&#39;ve set our sights on powering every television in the world. Roku pioneered streaming to the TV. Our mission is to be the TV streaming platform that connects the entire TV ecosystem. We connect consumers to the content they love, enable content publishers to build and monetize large audiences, and provide advertisers unique capabilities to engage consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From your first day at Roku, you&#39;ll make a valuable - and valued - contribution. We&#39;re a fast-growing public company where no one is a bystander. We offer you the opportunity to delight millions of TV streamers around the world while gaining meaningful experience across a variety of disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What is the role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;Roku&#39;s Content Distribution team drives strategic growth by sourcing, negotiating, and closing distribution partnerships with leading streaming video providers and major TV networks. As Director, Content Distribution, UK, you will lead strategy and execution for Roku&#39;s content distribution business in the UK. You will directly own high-value, complex negotiations with local public service broadcasters (PSBs), operators, and digital distributors, and guide the long-term roadmap for partner acquisition, renewals, and revenue expansion in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;This role requires a senior leader with a proven track record of closing large, strategic content deals, deep expertise in streaming and subscription business models, and established C-level relationships across the UK media industry. You will shape how Roku is perceived by the local media community and represent Roku in the UK and EU.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;How will I use AI at Roku?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;At Roku, we don’t just use AI, we work with it. AI agents and smart tools help power drafts, analysis, and repetitive workflows, while our people bring direction, judgment, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;We value curious, adaptable builders, who can show how they’ve used AI, agents, or automation to move faster, improve quality, and scale their impact. Strong candidates know how to frame problems, guide AI-assisted work, check the output, and learn quickly. Above all, they bring curiosity, adaptability, and sound judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What are the responsibilities of the role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Deal Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end negotiation of major content distribution, premium subscription, and advertising inventory deals with UK PSBs (e.g., BBC, ITV, Channel 4), operators, and SVOD, AVOD, TVOD, and premium channel providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Own the strategic vision, roadmap, and financial performance of UK Content Distribution, including revenue management, ensuring sustained partner and revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary executive-level relationship owner for key UK partners, driving alignment on long-term collaboration, business strategy, and deal expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Negotiate advertising arrangements, including ad inventory splits, revenue shares, and backfill agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development &amp;amp; Deal Structuring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Lead all aspects of new partner development, including sourcing, financial modeling, forecasting, term-sheet creation, contract drafting, negotiations, and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Own renewal strategy for the installed base of UK contracts, including re-negotiating major deals and developing a plan to upgrade existing Roku partnerships to the next level, in partnership with Roku&#39;s Legal team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Provide cross-functional leadership to legal, finance, marketing, product, and ad sales teams throughout negotiations and ongoing partnership management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics, Strategy, &amp;amp; Executive Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Develop and present strategic materials, including deal strategies, quarterly updates, executive level presentations, and analysis of the UK media landscape and broader industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Evaluate potential channel partners using deep analysis of content value, market demand and appeal, competitive positioning, financial modeling, and long-term strategic fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Continuously analyze current channel applications and competitor lineups to prioritize channel onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Monitor industry trends, competitive dynamics, and the evolving UK streaming ecosystem to inform Roku&#39;s content distribution strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Support the content acquisition team by researching content trends, identifying ad innovations, and recommending new partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Oversee the lifecycle of UK partner contracts, including compliance, renewals, and operational optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Build and mentor a high-performing team focused on complex negotiations, partner management, and business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Establish scalable processes to manage a large and diverse portfolio of partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-xl&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;What experience would help someone be successful in this role at Roku?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [li_&amp;amp;]:pl-6&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;unordered-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in content distribution, business development, or media partnerships at a leading broadcaster, operator, streaming platform, or media company, including direct ownership of major deal negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;A proven, high-level network of traditional and digital media executives across the UK, including direct experience working with C-level leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of subscription streaming models, linear licensing agreements, and advertising economics, including the UK advertising ecosystem, ad inventory pricing and structures, and direct, programmatic, and audience-based monetization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Extensive experience working with legal teams on complex distribution agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Strong executive presence and exceptional communication skills, with the ability to influence and build relationships with senior and mid-level leaders, internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Demonstrated excellence in financial modeling, competitive analysis, and strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Revenue management experience, and experience working with media sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;A demonstrated passion for the UK media landscape and a solid understanding of streaming media technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Proven success leading cross-functional initiatives and managing multiple high-impact deals simultaneously, with 5+ years of people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required; MBA, JD, or similar advanced degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;mt-6 mb-2 font-semibold text-sm&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;heading-6&quot;&gt;#LI-OR1&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 my-2.5 last:mb-0 first:mt-0 &quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Roku&#39;s approach to hybrid working?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku fosters an inclusive and collaborative environment where teams generally work in the office Monday through Thursday. Fridays are generally flexible for remote work, except for employees whose specific roles or assigned office location require five days&#39; a week attendance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are some of the benefits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is committed to offering a diverse range of benefits as part of our compensation package to support our employees and their families. Our comprehensive benefits include global access to mental health and financial wellness support and resources. Local benefits include statutory and voluntary benefits which may include healthcare (medical, dental, and vision), life, accident, disability, commuter, and retirement options (401(k)/pension). Employees are supported in taking time off, in accordance with local leave policies and other personal needs to support their evolving work and life needs. It&#39;s important to note that not every benefit is available in all locations or for every role. For details specific to your location, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku welcomes applicants of all backgrounds and provides reasonable accommodations and adjustments in accordance with applicable law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any point in the hiring process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-family: GothamBold,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What should I know about Roku&#39;s culture?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roku is a great place for people who want to work in a fast-paced environment where everyone is focused on the company&#39;s success rather than their own. We try to surround ourselves with people who are great at their jobs, who are easy to work with, and who keep their egos in check. We appreciate a sense of humor. We believe a fewer number of very talented folks can do more for less cost than a larger number of less talented teams. We&#39;re independent thinkers with big ideas who act boldly, move fast and accomplish extraordinary things through collaboration and trust. In short, at Roku you&#39;ll be part of a company that&#39;s changing how the world watches TV. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique culture that we are proud of. We think of ourselves primarily as problem-solvers, which itself is a two-part idea. We come up with the solution, but the solution isn&#39;t real until it is built and delivered to the customer. That penchant for action gives us a pragmatic approach to innovation, one that has served us well since 2002. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about Roku, our global footprint, and how we&#39;ve grown, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&quot;&gt;https://www.weareroku.com/factsheet&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By providing your information, you acknowledge that you want Roku to contact you about job roles, that you have read Roku&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.weareroku.com/roku-job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-job-applicants&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, and understand that Roku will use your information as described in that notice. If you do not wish to receive any communications from Roku regarding this role or similar roles in the future, you may unsubscribe at any time by emailing &lt;a ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identity is now the front door for attackers, and governments, banks, hospitals and critical infrastructure providers rely on Rubrik to recover fast when systems like Active Directory and Entra ID are compromised. As Regional Director, Identity Sales Specialist, you’ll lead a team of six identity specialists across EMEA and APJ, turning a new category-defining product into a repeatable revenue motion in some of the most regulated markets in the world. You’ll report to the RVP, Identity and have real ownership over how the team is built, how it sells and how it grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coach a team of six identity specialists across EMEA and APJ, so each of them can run executive-level conversations that create urgency around identity risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the identity resilience number for your regions, working with the RVP and regional sales leaders to make identity a core part of every strategic security conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the regional go-to-market strategy into territory plans, target segments and priority verticals that put Rubrik in front of the buyers who feel identity risk most acutely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into strategic deals alongside Account Executives and Sales Engineers, engaging CISOs, CIOs and identity and infrastructure leaders to close complex, multi-stakeholder opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build pipeline with the regional field, channel and alliances teams, equipping partners and sellers to lead with identity from first meeting to signature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with GSIs, identity and security ecosystem partners and specialist resellers to create joint plays that extend Rubrik’s reach beyond the direct motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a disciplined rhythm of forecasting, pipeline reviews and deal inspection that gives the RVP a clear, accurate view of the business and helps your team win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring regional customer and competitive insight back to Product and Marketing, so what Rubrik builds reflects what customers across EMEA and APJ actually need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop and retain top identity talent, building the bench that will take this motion to its next stage of growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Experience You’ll Need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience selling identity security, IAM, privileged access or adjacent cybersecurity solutions into enterprise and public sector customers, with a track record of exceeding quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading and developing a team of sellers, specialists or overlays, ideally across multiple geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success leading complex, executive-level sales cycles with CISOs and senior security and infrastructure stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the identity threat landscape, including Active Directory and Entra ID attack paths, and the ability to translate technical risk into business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing field teams without direct authority, and building or scaling a new product motion through GTM planning, pipeline creation and enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating across the diverse markets, regulatory environments and buying cultures of EMEA and APJ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly across both regions for customer, partner and team engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling in the cyber resilience, data security or identity recovery space, including familiarity with identity security and AD recovery vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with GSIs, identity-focused partners and security-focused resellers in EMEA and/or APJ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with channel-led and partner-influenced selling models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in an additional language relevant to EMEA or APJ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
