&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Digital and Technology (D&amp;amp;T) Strategy Practice are looking for an experienced Senior Consultants to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In our Digital and Technology (D&amp;amp;T) Strategy Practice we bring strategy to life, enabling our clients to unlock the true meaning of Digital and the underlying technologies, allowing them to benefit from real innovative digital business models, helping them to be among the “first movers” and scale their digital ecosystem. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for more great people to join our Digital and Strategy practice; new colleagues with a passion for a high-performance culture, problem solving, enabling growth and delivering value through the use of technology to help CIOs deliver cost effective, positive and tailored user and customer experiences. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our industry growth along with our continued progressive geographic expansion means that we can offer our employees great progression and development across a diverse range of engagements. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who can contribute to the success of the D&amp;amp;T Technology Strategy team and help build new capabilities, particularly around digital strategy, where technology connects with customer experience and engagement. You will be helping our clients transform their organisations, deploy new business models, optimise their IT spend, source better, improve ways of working, comply with regulation and exploit new digital technologies such as XaaS, cloud, artificial intelligence or the internet of things. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;As well as spending time with our client’s teams to understand their strategy and technology concerns, you will be working with our subject matter experts across industry and technology sectors to ensure we bring our cutting edge thinking and expertise to our clients. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of digital and technology-enabled strategies and transformation roadmaps aligned to business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technology maturity assessments, providing strategic recommendations and improvement plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and oversee the implementation of digital and technology solutions to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage supplier and partner ecosystem activities, including vendor strategy, selection, and procurement support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate stakeholder engagement and define customer experience strategies with senior client leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own business cases and investment recommendations to support technology and digital initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the optimisation of technology operating models, governance frameworks, and organisational capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive portfolio planning, IT investment prioritisation, cost optimisation, and benefits realisation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technology workstreams for M&amp;amp;A, post-merger integration (PMI), and separation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the delivery of sustainable technology initiatives, while managing project teams, risks, and client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;35&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A background in transformation programmes with the innovative use of technology such as Web3, IoT, cloud services, top MarTech Platforms (e.g. Salesforce, Adobe), channel technology strategy or sustainable technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;35&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Exposure to organisation design, optimisation and organisational change programmes&lt;/li&gt;
