&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll help us build and maintain high-performance systems that power our hyper-local marketplace, ensuring a seamless experience for millions of users. This role is based in our London office with a &lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; setup, typically 3 days in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
