&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave + 1 Volunteer Day &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa Healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Maternity, Adoption and Shared Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a Flexible Working Model with core working hours: 10am – 4pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1.5:1 Matching Pension Structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing and Health: Up to £25.00 per month towards physical or online exercise class membership, Unmind membership, LifeWorks tool and annual eye tests and development budgets and Wellbeing incentives and activities throughout the year &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan and Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Our ambition is to attract the very best diverse talent to Ogilvy, and to be the employer of choice in the UK. We want everyone to feel welcome when they join us, and once they’re here, for them to want to stay with us, grow their career, and to feel they belong with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and we’re committed to creating an inclusive, welcoming environment for everyone who wants to work at Ogilvy. For us, diversity, equity and inclusion is integrated into everything that we do. We believe that for creativity to flourish, everything about how we work must have diversity at its core. Your race, colour, ethnic, religion, gender, gender identity, national origin, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, have no bearing on our hiring decisions, but we encourage everyone to feel free to express their true selves in an environment we are consistently striving to make as inclusive as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;We aim to facilitate an accessible and positive application experience for all candidates. If you require any adjustments from us to support you through the process or expect to require any adjustments to working conditions to be able to best perform in the role, please let us know. We are happy to consider all reasonable adjustments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;If you live with a disability and you would like to take advantage of our offer of a guaranteed interview under the Disability Confident Scheme, please ensure you fill out our voluntary Equal Opportunities Questionnaire when applying.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy Health, we work with ambitious healthcare brands to create work that makes a meaningful difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join us, working on an exciting global respiratory account. This is a brilliant opportunity for someone ready for real ownership. You’ll have the autonomy to run the account day to day, build a strong relationship with the client and play a leading role in where the partnership goes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining a supportive team, but there’s plenty of space to make the account your own. With a strong pipeline of work ahead and a growing client relationship, you’ll have genuine visibility and the opportunity to make an impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll gain further global experience, work across campaign launches and major congress activity, and have a senior team around you when you need it, while still being trusted to lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re a Senior Account Manager looking for a role where you can &lt;strong&gt;step up, have a voice and genuinely make an account your own&lt;/strong&gt;, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take the lead on the day-to-day running of the account, working closely with the client and wider Ogilvy team to keep everything moving in the right direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s a great mix of work to get involved in, from taking an established US campaign and helping bring it to global markets, to developing market toolkits, promotional materials and supporting major congress activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the day-to-day client relationship and becoming a trusted partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership of the account and keeping priorities, projects and teams moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading global campaign work, including adapting and rolling out campaign materials across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing the development of promotional materials and communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with strategy, creative, medical and project management teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Playing a leading role in major congress activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spotting opportunities to strengthen and grow the client relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting and developing more junior members of the account team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing confidence, good judgement and a collaborative approach to everything you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll already have good experience gained at the Account Manager level within a healthcare communications agency, ideally working with prescription pharmaceutical brands and global accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’d particularly love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Rx/pharmaceutical healthcare communications experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on global campaigns and launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence managing senior day-to-day client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of promotional work and the pharmaceutical environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating work across different markets and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The confidence to lead an account and make decisions without needing lots of direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts and an interest in helping an account grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, low-ego approach to leadership&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;How We’ll Support You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ogilvy celebrates its people. Fully. Enthusiastically. Unhesitatingly. We’ll empower you with the tools you’ll need to succeed. We’ll give you the autonomy to seek out new paths and better ways of doing things. We’ll support you with colleagues who are experts in their disciplines, drawn from across the Ogilvy network. And we’ll provide opportunities for you to do work of which you’ll be proud, with people you’ll be proud to call your teammates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days’ annual leave, increasing to 30 days with service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your birthday and Christmas off, plus one volunteer day per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working, with core hours of 10am–4pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from anywhere in the UK for up to four weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa healthcare, including access to a virtual GP and second opinion service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced pension contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health counselling and wider wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly contribution towards fitness and lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-demand learning, development and professional coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family-friendly policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
